This BBS does not have the file, only its listing. File contents never travel
the mesh, at any size, so there is nothing to download here.

Press r to ask for it. The request is written down and travels with the next
exchange of records between boards — no date, because an exchange happens when
somebody carries it — and you are told when the file lands.

